  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "jameelahmediqbal57483",
      "content": "The best movie ever made in 2026. \r\n\r\nIt's the best psychological thriller after fight club and best action sequences after KGF and Marco. \r\n\r\nGreat direction and best acting by everyone.",
      "rating": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T19:26:09Z"
    },
    {
      "author": "dinaaesh7938",
      "content": "This movie is a perfect example of why we should think twice before looking up to or being inspired by anyone.\r\n\r\nI’m not here to judge the morals of any character. That’s the creator’s freedom, and I couldn’t care less about what choices they make. But as a movie, this is a fucking mess.\r\n\r\nThe screenplay is bad. The plot makes little sense. The story development is all over the place. There is barely any character development, and almost every character feels shallow and underwritten. The abrupt scene cuts make it even worse, and half the time you’re left wondering what the hell is happening.\r\n\r\nAnd seriously, what exactly is the director trying to tell us with this movie?",
      "rating": 1,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-31T19:11:26Z"
    }
  ],
