    "summary_one_sentence": "Set during the decline of Portuguese colonial rule, a gritty and violent power struggle unfolds beneath a sun-soaked facade as a ruthless drug cartel fights to maintain its grip.",
    "summary_short": "Amid the backdrop of sun-drenched beaches and crumbling colonial authority, a powerful drug cartel secretly controls the region's economy and politics. As imperial power falters, a brutal underworld war erupts among rival factions vying for control of the lucrative illicit trade. Caught in the violent crossfire, key players must navigate deception, betrayal, and shifting allegiances to survive. The conflict exposes the dark, toxic reality hiding beneath the tropical paradise's serene exterior.",
